OL,3,AMan guilty of killing student after
OL,4,Afake Rolex row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who stabbed his former friend
OL,7,Fthrough the heart in Leicester after
OL,8,Fthey fell out over a fake Rolex watch
OL,9,Fhas been found guilty of manslaughter.
OL,11,FHarper Dennis, 19, plunged a knife five
OL,12,Ftimes into the chest of Khaleed
OL,13,FOladipo, 20, near De Montfort
OL,14,FUniversity in Leicester on the evening
OL,15,Fof February 3 this year.
OL,17,FA jury at Leicester Crown Court found
OL,18,FDennis not guilty of murder but guilty
OL,19,Fof manslaughter, having an offensive
OL,20,Fweapon and failing to provide the pin
OL,21,Fto his phone after a two-week trial.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
